          ],
          "size": 22,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Regress with SSIM + MSE; strength 0.90 → 0.01; QR weighted 3×",
          "rect": [
            20,
            498,
            920,
            32
          ],
          "size": 20,
          "color": "#C00000"
        }
      ],
      "speech": "Score distillation alone gives gritty images, top row, four Mikus hiding Captain Picard. So phase two: each round, we SDEdit every derived image into a cleaner version, the middle row, and regress the primes toward those targets with SSIM plus MSE for about a thousand steps. The SDEdit strength starts at 0.9 and shrinks toward 0.01, so targets move less each round. The QR image gets weight three. Bottom row is after. Our default: 500 score distillation steps, then 8 rounds."
    },
